# Applies to every image build (all three Dockerfiles use the repo root as
# build context). The builder stages run `pnpm install` and rebuild all
# workspace packages from source inside the image, so no host-built output
# and no host node_modules should ever enter the context.

# dependencies — always reinstalled in the builder
**/node_modules

# build outputs — every dist (tsup, vite) is rebuilt inside the builders;
# nothing in any Dockerfile COPYs a host dist
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# vcs / ci / deploy metadata — irrelevant to image content
.git
.github
charts

# test and perf artifacts
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
tools/perf/report

# scratch
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.vite
